"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-white text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-light\">Studio</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"border border-[#1E00FF] text-white text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-600/10 transition-all duration-300\" href=\"/contact\">Let&#x27;s Talk</a><button class=\"text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(16px)\"><main class=\"bg-black text-white min-h-screen\"><section class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)\"><section class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-black\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-grid opacity-40 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(80,0,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%)\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.04]\" style=\"background-image:url(&#x27;/bg-logo.png&#x27;);background-size:cover;background-position:center\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto\" style=\"padding:clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 2rem)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start\"><div class=\"slide-left flex-1\"><p class=\"section-label mb-4\">Our Story</p><h2 class=\"font-black text-white leading-tight mb-6\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem)\">Built in 2024.<br/><span class=\"gradient-text-purple\">Building for the Future.</span></h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-white/55 leading-relaxed\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.9rem, 1.3vw, 1.05rem)\"><p>A collective of builders and problem solvers on a mission to build real digital products that make a difference — across multiple projects, every day.</p><p><a class=\"font-bold text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">NV Studio</a> <!-- -->was founded in 2024 with a simple belief: great products come from focused teams, working in parallel, with a shared mission.</p><p>We operate on a multi-project model, where dedicated teams build, ship, and scale digital products across different industries simultaneously.</p><p>From<!-- --> <a class=\"font-bold text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">InstaUp AI</a> <!-- -->to<!-- --> <a class=\"font-bold text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Alfreela</a> <!-- -->to<!-- --> <a class=\"font-bold text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">UstaUp</a>, our ecosystem of products is growing — and we&#x27;re just getting started.</p></div></div><div class=\"slide-right flex-1 lg:max-w-md w-full\"><p class=\"text-white/40 font-medium mb-5 uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.7rem, 1vw, 0.8rem)\">Our Products</p><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"glass-card rgb-glow-card rounded-2xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 group\" style=\"padding:clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;background:#7c3aed22;border:1px solid #7c3aed44\"><img alt=\"SifarişX logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fsifarisx.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fsifarisx.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fsifarisx.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-white font-semibold\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.875rem, 1.2vw, 1rem)\">SifarişX</div><div class=\"text-white/40 mt-0.5\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.75rem, 1vw, 0.8rem)\">AI-powered growth platform</div></div><span class=\"text-white/20 group-hover:text-white/50 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-200\">→</span></div><div class=\"glass-card rgb-glow-card rounded-2xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 group\" style=\"padding:clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;background:#0891b222;border:1px solid #0891b244\"><img alt=\"Alfreela logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Falfreela.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Falfreela.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Falfreela.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-white font-semibold\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.875rem, 1.2vw, 1rem)\">Alfreela</div><div class=\"text-white/40 mt-0.5\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.75rem, 1vw, 0.8rem)\">Real estate digital solutions</div></div><span class=\"text-white/20 group-hover:text-white/50 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-200\">→</span></div><div class=\"glass-card rgb-glow-card rounded-2xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 group\" style=\"padding:clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;background:#05966922;border:1px solid #05966944\"><img alt=\"UstaUp logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fustaup.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fustaup